is this payable.. did  i ahve to pay to use this whatsapp featuer in my saas website
The WhatsApp Business Platform (API) uses a per-message pricing model, where you are charged for each message delivered to a customer. While there is no flat monthly fee to use the API itself, costs are determined by the category of the message and the country of the recipient.
Key Pricing Details
Message Categories: Charges vary based on whether the message is for marketing, utility, or authentication.
Free Service Messages: You are not charged for service messages (free-form replies) sent to customers within a 24-hour customer service window.
Free Entry Points: If a customer messages you from an ad that clicks to WhatsApp or a Facebook Page action button, it opens a 72-hour window where all messages are free.
Volume Tiers: As your monthly message volume increases, you can unlock lower rates for utility and authentication messages.
For specific rates, you can review the WhatsApp Business Platform rate cards.
